{"id":"method-input-domain-correspondence","html":"<section class=\"contract\" id=\"contract\"><h2>什么时候用</h2><dl><dt>适合什么题</dt><dd>已知抽象对应关系 f 的输入范围，或某个复合写法关于外层自变量的定义域；以及目标调用式。</dd><dt>最后要得到什么</dt><dd>目标表达式关于外层自变量的定义域。</dd><dt>要注意</dt><dd>第一批：已知恰为 f(x) 的定义域（exact），目标为 f(ax+b)，a、b 为固定有理数；可另给外层范围。不含由复合式反推输入范围、不含与根式分母混合。</dd></dl></section><section id=\"path\"><h2>解题步骤</h2><p class=\"muted\">按顺序做。标了条件的技能，只在题目符合那个条件时才用。</p><ol class=\"method-path\" aria-label=\"解题步骤\"><li id=\"solve\"><div class=\"step-title\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>用输入范围对应求定义域</h3><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#solve\" aria-label=\"定位到用输入范围对应求定义域\">#</a></div><p>由已知定义域求出 f 的输入范围。</p><p>找出目标函数交给 f 的完整输入，列出该输入须落在输入范围内的条件。</p><p>解出目标函数关于外层自变量的定义域。</p><div class=\"step-calls is-inline\"><p class=\"rel-label\">这一步用到</p><ul><li><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"skill\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/skill-inequality-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>不等式变形与推导</a></li></ul></div></li></ol></section><section id=\"basis\"><h2>背后用到的知识</h2><p class=\"muted\">上面各步骤用到的性质和公式。做一道具体的题，通常只用到其中一部分。</p><div class=\"chips\"><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#addition\">不等式的性质 · 同加减与同向相加</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#multiplication\">不等式的性质 · 乘除与方向</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/inequality-properties/#reciprocal\">不等式的性质 · 同号两数取倒数</a><a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/real-order/#difference\">不等式与实数大小关系 · 作差判号</a></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>例题</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 已知 f(x) 定义域求复合定义域</h3><p class=\"problem\">已知 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-3,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>，</span>求 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(2x-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 的定义域。</p><ol><li>f 的输入范围是 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[-3,2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li>完整输入为 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2x-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>，</span>列 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-3\\le 2x-1\\le 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>。</span></li><li>解得 <span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in[-1,\\frac{3}{2}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span>。</span></li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数专题第 25 题</p></article></section>"}
